.TH REMOTE-APP 1 "2026-01-01" "remote-app 0.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
remote-app \- secure native remote computing client
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B remote-app
.br
.B remote-app-headless
.RI [ COMMAND ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Remote App provides native terminal, SSH, SFTP, Telnet, VNC, RDP, serial, and
port-forwarding workflows. Credentials are stored only in the encrypted
session store when explicitly saved.
.SH FILES
.I ~/.config/remote-app/
contains encrypted sessions, configuration, and logs.
.SH SECURITY
SSH host keys are checked against known_hosts. Do not approve an unknown or
changed key without verifying its fingerprint through an independent channel.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.B RUST_LOG
controls structured logging verbosity.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR ssh (1),
.BR sftp (1)
